# Git workflow

## Branches

- Format: `type/kebab-case-topic`
- Types: `chore`, `fix`, `refactor`, `feat`, `docs`
- One theme per branch / PR; do not mix unrelated concerns
- Base work on updated `main` after each merged PR

## Commits

- Format: `type(scope): short imperative summary`
- Examples: `fix(users): prevent self-assignment of manager role on signup`
- One logical change per commit
- Do not commit unless the user asks (user rule for this project)

## PRs

- Keep title aligned with the main intent (`chore:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `docs:`)
- Prefer small, reviewable diffs over large unrelated refactors
